  "genderDifference": "Males are mostly blue with white highlights, the inverse of females. Male's eyes are green with light blue sclerae, while female's are red and yellow. The moves Meowstic can learn vary by gender, with males learning more status moves and females learning more damaging moves. Male Meowstic have the Hidden Ability {{a|Prankster}}, while female Meowstic have the Hidden Ability {{a|Competitive}}. In Pokémon Sword and Shield, all {{pkmn2|wild}} Meowstic are male in Sword and female in Shield. However, evolving Espurr allows both genders to be obtained in either version.|7=-Male|artdif=yes",
